<title>USA: GC Cos Inc Q4 Oct 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>GC Cos Inc Q4 Oct 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(IN THOUSANDS, EXCEPT FOR PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>					   Year	    Fourth Quarter</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>    Admissions		$302,852 $309,562  $58,152  $69,816</p>
<p>    Concessions		131,500  132,159   25,459   29,489</p>
<p>    Other			 11,651    9,587    3,042    2,105</p>
<p>				   446,003  451,308   86,653  101,410</p>
<p>Gain/(loss) on disposition</p>
<p>   of theatre assets	   (540)    (463)	199    (204)</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)	 17,242    8,705    4,539  ( 2,311)</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>    outstanding		 7,851    7,855    7,851    7,813</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss)</p>
<p>    per share		   2.20     1.11     0.58    ( 0.30)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results include Q4 pretax charge of $5.0 million, or $0.38/shr, for writedown of investment in children's clothing retailer; a total of $7.9 million of writedowns in year.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 profit includes pretax gain of $9.5 million, or $0.71/shr, from sale of Crescent Communications and charge of $2.5 million for writedown of remaining retailer investment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
